"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Heavy Ion and Proton Therapy - Advanced Cancer Treatment\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#F5F7FA] pt-10 pb-20\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-20 h-20 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">重离子/质子治疗</h1><p class=\"text-xl text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium mb-4\">精准\"定向爆破\"肿瘤，守护生命之光</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">重离子（碳离子）和质子治疗是目前国际公认最先进的肿瘤放射治疗技术。精准集中于肿瘤，实现亚毫米级的\"定点爆破\"，同时最大限度地保护周边正常组织，显著降低治疗副作用。中国已在粒子放疗领域跻身国际先进行列，成为全球重离子技术临床应用创新的领跑者。</p></div><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-[#1A1A2E]\">核心优势 – 为什么选择中国？</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">世界一流临床疗效</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">粒子放疗患者5年总生存率达70.4%，初治鼻咽癌5年生存率93.8%，局限期前列腺癌5年生存率97.2%，达到国际领先水平</p></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">治疗周期短、等候快</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">多家中心提供VIP绿色通道，优先为海外患者安排治疗，候诊时间缩短至3-5天以内</p></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">显著的性价比优势</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">同样采用国际顶级设备（瓦里安ProBeam、迈胜Mevion等），治疗总费用仅为发达国家的1/4–1/5</p></div></div></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4\"><div class=\"p-2 bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 rounded-lg flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">国际化服务水平高</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">百余位境外患者慕名来华治疗，医院配置英语/多语言服务、国际保险直付系统，海外患者就医全程无忧</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-[#1A1A2E]\">适应症 – 哪些肿瘤适合治疗？</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-8 text-center\">重离子和质子治疗尤其适合对常规放疗不敏感、位于重要器官附近或儿童/青少年患者。目前可收治50余种常见肿瘤疾病。</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-red-700 mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg>头颈部</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-red-500 mr-2\">•</span>鼻咽癌、口咽癌、喉癌</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-red-500 mr-2\">•</span>颅内颅底肿瘤（脑膜瘤、脊索瘤等）</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-red-500 mr-2\">•</span>髓母细胞瘤、室管膜瘤等</li></ul></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-orange-50 rounded-xl\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-orange-700 mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart mr-2\"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg>胸腹部</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-orange-500 mr-2\">•</span>肺癌（非小细胞肺癌）</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-orange-500 mr-2\">•</span>乳腺癌</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-orange-500 mr-2\">•</span>食管癌</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-orange-500 mr-2\">•</span>肝癌</li></ul></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-purple-700 mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield mr-2\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg>盆腔及其他</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-purple-500 mr-2\">•</span>前列腺癌</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-purple-500 mr-2\">•</span>胰腺癌</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-purple-500 mr-2\">•</span>骨软组织肿瘤（骨肉瘤、脊索瘤等）</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-purple-500 mr-2\">•</span>肾癌、直肠癌</li></ul></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-green-50 rounded-xl\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-green-700 mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg>特别推荐</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-green-500 mr-2\">•</span>儿童肿瘤（世界公认儿童实体瘤优选方案）</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-green-500 mr-2\">•</span>复发/难治性肿瘤（如局部复发鼻咽癌等）</li><li class=\"flex items-start\"><span class=\"text-green-500 mr-2\">•</span>毗邻重要功能区的复杂部位肿瘤</li></ul></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-6 text-center\">注：是否适合接受重离子/质子治疗，需由多学科专家团队进行个体化评估。</p></section><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-[#1A1A2E]\">治疗内容（医疗服务部分）</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1B4D3E] mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle mr-2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>医疗核心服务</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>多学科会诊与评估 – 由肿瘤学家、放射物理学家、放疗专科医生等组成MDT团队</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>高精度模拟定位 – 通过CT/MRI等影像设备获取肿瘤及周围组织的精确三维图像</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>个性化治疗计划设计 – 利用先进计划系统精确计算离子束入射角度、深度及剂量分布</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>固定模具制作 – 为每位患者量身制作体位固定模具</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>离子束治疗实施 – 每次治疗全程约15–30分钟，实际照射1–3分钟</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>治疗期间专业护理与密切监测 – 每日治疗前后专业医护团队全程陪护</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1B4D3E] mb-4 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award mr-2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg>高端配套服务</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>全病程诊疗服务 – 从初次门诊到治疗结束的专家诊疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>全面检查检验 – 治疗前、中、后期的全部影像学检查（PET-CT/MR）、实验室检验等</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>高端特需病房 – 入住单人间/套房级高端病房，配备独立卫浴、生活设施及专业护理团队</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>对症支持治疗及辅助药物 – 治疗期间所需全部药品及支持治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-700 text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[#1B4D3E] mr-2 mt-0.5\">•</span><span>出院康复指导与长期随访 – 制定个性化康复计划，定期复查提醒</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-[#1A1A2E]\">治疗流程（从初诊至康复）</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4 p-4 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0\">1</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">1. 远程咨询与初筛</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2–5天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">提交病历资料，多学科专家团队远程评估，初步制定治疗方案</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4 p-4 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0\">2</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">2. 签证与行程安排</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">1–2周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">医疗签证邀请函、国际保险对接、行程规划与高端住宿安排</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4 p-4 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0\">3</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">3. 抵华与入院评估</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">2–3天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">全面身体检查、影像学定位、固定模具制作，直接入住VIP病房</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4 p-4 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0\">4</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">4. 治疗计划制定</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">3–5天</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">靶区勾画、剂量计算、治疗计划审核与验证</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4 p-4 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0\">5</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">5. 治疗实施</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">5–6周</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">每日一次质子/重离子照射，全程无痛，全程享受专业医护团队全天候照护</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start space-x-4 p-4 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1B4D3E] text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold flex-shrink-0\">6</div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">6. 康复与随访</h3><span class=\"text-sm text-[#1B4D3E] font-medium bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">持续</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">出院后定期复查，远程随访管理，病情监测不中断</p></div></div></div><p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mt-6\">从抵华至完成治疗，全程通常需6–8周。</p></section><section class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1B4D3E] to-[#2E7D32] rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12 text-white\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center\">疗效 – 中国临床数据（2026版）</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"text-center p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">70.4%</div><div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">粒子放疗患者5年总生存率</div></div><div class=\"text-center p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">83.8%</div><div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">0–Ⅰ期患者5年总生存率</div></div><div class=\"text-center p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">82.1%</div><div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">Ⅱ期患者5年总生存率</div></div><div class=\"text-center p-6 bg-white/10 rounded-xl\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-2\">4.2%</div><div class=\"text-sm opacity-90\">3级不良反应发生率</div></div></div><p class=\"text-center text-sm opacity-70 mt-6\">数据来源：上海市质子重离子医院2026版生存报告，截至2026年5月，累计治疗患者9317例</p></section><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-[#1A1A2E]\">案例展示</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1B4D3E] mb-3 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users mr-2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>案例一：伊拉克青年Aron的七千公里希望之旅</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">来自伊拉克的Aron罹患脑膜瘤，经历三次开颅手术后肿瘤仍反复复发。根据国际权威NCCN指南推荐，质子治疗被列为肿瘤紧邻脑干、脊髓及视神经等关键区域的脑肿瘤的优先选项。经跨洋视频会诊，中国医院的专家为其制定了精准质子治疗方案。患者顺利完成30次质子放疗后敲响\"康复之鼓\"，\"从伊拉克到中国跨越7000公里的信任，换来的是生命的重生。\"</p></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1B4D3E] mb-3 flex items-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users mr-2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>案例二：印尼罕见脊索瘤患者的中国\"救赎\"</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">30多岁的印尼青年Rafi确诊脊索瘤（发病率仅百万分之一）后，辗转印尼、马来西亚均被告知建议质子治疗，但当地并无该设备。在全球搜索中，他们比较了多个国家的费用后，最终选择了中国医院——总费用不到新加坡的一半。经多学科团队联合制定\"手术+质子\"整合方案，Rafi顺利完成了治疗。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center text-[#1A1A2E]\">治疗费用</h2><div class=\"text-center\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">中国提供质子/重离子治疗的全程特需医疗服务套餐，采用一口价收费模式，涵盖门诊、检查、治疗、药物、高端病房及全程护理，价格透明，无任何隐藏费用。</p><div class=\"inline-block bg-[#1B4D3E]/10 text-[#1B4D3E] px-8 py-4 rounded-xl\"><span class=\"text-sm\">参考全程治疗费用:</span><span class=\"text-2xl font-bold ml-2\">$28,000 – $42,000 USD</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm mt-4\">（具体费用以医院最终评估为准。）</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-sm mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-8 text-center text-[#1A1A2E] flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle mr-3 text-[#1B4D3E]\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>选择我们的理由</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">国际顶尖水平</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">粒子放疗临床疗效达国际先进水平，多家中心通过JCI认证</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">重离子技术领跑者</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">中国是全球重离子技术临床应用创新的领跑者，拥有自主知识产权重离子系统</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">直通中国顶级质子重离子中心</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">与上海、山东、广州、武汉、甘肃、安徽等多家顶级中心建立正式合作</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">价格透明，全程一口价</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">特需医疗套餐收费，医疗费用直付医院，平台不经手、不加价，无隐藏费用</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">VIP病房尊享体验</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">全程入住单人间/套房级高端病房，配备专业医护团队全天候照护</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">高效排期、VIP绿色通道</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">2–3周内完成初诊评估和治疗启动，避免欧美长期等候</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">全程双语服务</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">病历翻译、现场口译、国际保险对接，一站式支持</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5F7FA] rounded-xl text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.95);\"><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2 text-sm\">长期随访管理</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-xs\">治疗后持续远程随访，病情监测不中断</p></div></div></section><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-[#1B4D3E] to-[#2E7D32] rounded-2xl p-10 text-center text-white\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">开启您的重离子/质子治疗之旅</h2><p class=\"mb-6 opacity-90\">联系我们的专业团队，获取免费远程评估和治疗方案</p><a href=\"/contact\" class=\"inline-flex items-center bg-white text-[#1B4D3E] px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-semibold hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">立即咨询<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></main>"